ng\",\n      \"pricing strategy\"\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"opinion\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Firefox 150 includes fixes for 271 vulnerabilities from Claude Mythos Preview\",\n    \"description\": \"Mozilla applied early Claude Mythos Preview model to Firefox evaluation, resulting in 271 vulnerability fixes. Firefox CTO: 'Defenders finally have a chance to win, decisively.'\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison (citing Bobby Holley)\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-04-22\",\n    \"topics\": [\n      \"AI security\",\n      \"firefox\",\n      \"claude\",\n      \"mozilla\",\n      \"vulnerability detection\"\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"title\": \"Where's the raccoon with the ham radio? (ChatGPT Images 2.0)\",\n    \"description\": \"OpenAI released ChatGPT Images 2.0. Sam Altman said the leap from gpt-image-1 to gpt-image-2 was equivalent to jumping from GPT-3 to GPT-5.\",\n    \"author\": \"Simon Willison\",\n    \"source\": \"Blog\",\n    \"url\": \"https://simonwillison.net/\",\n    \"published_date\": \"2026-04-21\",\n    \"topics\": [\n      \"image generation\",\n      \"openai\",\n      \"chatgpt\",\n      \"AI art\"\n    ],\n    \"type\": \"technical\"\n  }\n]\n",
