ng thinking from idle sessions\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">claude-code</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">bugs</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"external-link\">Qwen3.6-27B: Flagship-Level Coding</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        27B dense model claiming flagship-level agentic coding performance, surpassing previous 397B MoE\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">LLM</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">local-llms</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"external-link\">Changes to GitHub Copilot Individual plans</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Tightened usage limits, paused signups, restricted Claude Opus 4.7 to Pro+ plan\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">github-copilot</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">pricing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"external-link\">Firefox 150: 271 vulnerability fixes from Claude Mythos</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Mozilla applied early Claude Mythos Preview model, resulting in 271 vulnerability fixes\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">AI security</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">firefox</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"external-link\">ChatGPT Images 2.0</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">\n                        Sam Altman said leap from gpt-image-1 to gpt-image-2 was equivalent to GPT-3 to GPT-5\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-type technical\">Technical</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">image generation</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic\">openai</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n\n        <footer>\n            <p>Generated on April 28, 2026 • <a href=\"https://github.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">AgentDaily</a> • Agentic Coding Research Report</p>\n            <p style=\"margin-top: 5px; color: #999;\">Curated daily updates on AI coding agents, development tools, and research</p>\n        </footer>\n    </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
